    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "'The War on Marriage'\n\nMy new interview with @NickJFreitas is out today.\n\nNow available on the Real Talk with Zuby podcast.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2060497446355222973",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-29T23:04:08+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It's easy to tell when someone forms their worldview mainly from the internet and social media rather than real world observation.\n\nThe gap between what seems true online vs what's true in reality can be immense.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2060064556060176479",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-28T18:23:58+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "People age over time, obviously. But a lot of what people call 'aging' is massively accelerated by years of bad decisions when it comes to food, drink, (lack of) exercise, and other habits.\n\nYou can stay in really good shape for a really long time. But you have to try.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2060015178092023866",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-28T15:07:46+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Congratulations! I remember when you had 4,000. \ud83d\ude4c\ud83c\udffe\n\n\nDan Go (@CoachDanGo)\n\nJust reached a million followers on X.\n\nIf you\u2019re reading this THANK YOU.\n\nI wouldn\u2019t be where I am without your support.\n\nI\u2019m on a mission to help a billion people look and feel 20 years younger.\n\nAnd we\u2019re just getting started.\n\nThank you again. Onwards and upwards \ud83d\ude80\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/CoachDanGo/status/2059724299611865306#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2059821919470240038",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-28T02:19:49+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I have found myself in Las Vegas again.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2059819119176806532",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-28T02:08:42+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Half my timeline is Americans and Europeans debating the importance of air conditioning. \ud83d\ude02\n\nFor what it's worth, I am firmly on Team AC.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2059725396149412231",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-27T19:56:16+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Next stops = Miami, Las Vegas, Dubai\n\nHot, hotter, hottest",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2059065376911007958",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-26T00:13:36+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Dominion AI (@Dominion_chat) is a new, Christian-built alternative to mainstream AI models like ChatGPT and Claude.\n\nI had a conversation with the founders to learn about why they created it, what it can do, and who it's for.\n\nThe full interview is now on X.\n\nTry Dominion here:\nget.dominion.chat/zuby-domin\u2026\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2058996556812988916",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-25T19:40:08+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It is the same temperature that it was 82 years ago because of climate change. Obviously.\n\n\nSky News (@SkyNews)\n\nBREAKING: The all-time May record temperature of 32.8C has been matched for the first time in 82 years\n\nnews.sky.com/story/weather-l\u2026\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/SkyNews/status/2058874216225579195#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2058988705591755030",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-25T19:08:56+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I've learned more useful stuff from X and YouTube than I learned from university. By a large margin.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2058979365786907029",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-25T18:31:49+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
